window.N29_I18N = {"fr":{"meta.title":"Djason Nathiez — Développeur Unity Gameplay freelance | STUDIO N29","meta.description":"Portfolio de Djason Nathiez, développeur Unity freelance spécialisé en programmation gameplay, systèmes et réseau multijoueur. Projets : Discosmos, Beat Strike, Heroes Dawn, Delight.","meta.title.project":"{name} — Jeu | STUDIO N29","nav.projects":"Projets","nav.about":"À propos","nav.skills":"Compétences","nav.journey":"Parcours","nav.contact":"Contact","nav.cta":"Me contacter","nav.menu":"Menu","skip":"Aller au contenu","hero.status":"Disponible pour missions freelance","hero.l1":"Du gameplay","hero.l2":"qui se <span class=\"accent\">ressent.</span>","hero.role":"<strong>Djason Nathiez</strong> — Unity Gameplay Programmer","hero.lead":"Développeur Unity freelance spécialisé en gameplay, systèmes et réseau. Je transforme une intention de design en mécaniques solides, lisibles et agréables à jouer.","hero.cta1":"Voir les projets","hero.cta2":"Me contacter","hero.scroll":"Défiler","projects.eyebrow":"Projets","projects.title":"Ce que j'ai construit.","projects.lead":"Réseau, sorts, rythme, contrôleurs, systèmes de combat. Pour chaque projet : ce que j'ai réellement réalisé.","projects.view":"Voir le projet","status.wip":"En cours","status.nda":"NDA","p.discosmos.type":"MOBA 3D · 2 mois","p.discosmos.role":"Lead réseau & sorts","p.discosmos.desc":"Infrastructure réseau synchrone et architecture des sorts d'un MOBA 3D compétitif, réalisé en deux mois.","p.discosmos.tagline":"Un MOBA 3D réalisé en deux mois, où le netcode fait toute la différence.","p.discosmos.meta.role":"Lead réseau & sorts","p.discosmos.meta.team":"Projet d'équipe · 2 mois","p.discosmos.ctx":"Discosmos est un MOBA 3D compétitif réalisé en deux mois sous Unity avec Photon. J'y ai mis en place l'ensemble de l'infrastructure réseau synchrone et l'architecture des sorts, en visant la latence la plus faible possible pour que chaque partie reste juste et lisible.","p.discosmos.c1":"<strong>Netcode synchrone</strong> : connexion, salles, gestion des joueurs et synchronisation de l'état de jeu avec Photon.","p.discosmos.c2":"<strong>Latence</strong> : optimisation et compensation du lag pour garder des actions réactives entre joueurs.","p.discosmos.c3":"<strong>Système de sorts</strong> : architecture des compétences des personnages, lancement et application des effets, répliqués sur le réseau.","p.discosmos.c4":"<strong>Code extensible</strong> : structuré pour que l'équipe puisse ajouter des sorts sans retoucher à la couche réseau.","p.beat-strike.type":"Rythme mobile","p.beat-strike.role":"Moteur de rythme & outil d'éditeur","p.beat-strike.desc":"Moteur de rythme haute précision sur mobile, boucle de gameplay principale et outil Unity pour composer les patterns.","p.beat-strike.tagline":"Un jeu de rythme mobile où chaque coup se joue sur le tempo.","p.beat-strike.meta.role":"Core dev & tooling","p.beat-strike.meta.team":"Projet d'équipe","p.beat-strike.ctx":"Dans Beat Strike, le niveau défile, des ennemis apparaissent et le joueur enchaîne des interactions synchronisées sur le tempo pour attaquer et esquiver. J'ai développé le moteur rythmique, la boucle de gameplay principale et un outil Unity (Capacity Tool) pour composer les patterns en temps réel.","p.beat-strike.c1":"<strong>Moteur de rythme haute précision</strong>, pensé pour rester juste sur mobile.","p.beat-strike.c2":"<strong>Capacity Tool</strong> : un éditeur Unity avec timeline (BPM, durée, type d'interaction : attaque, esquive haute / basse…) utilisable par les designers sans toucher au code.","p.beat-strike.c3":"<strong>Patterns par BPM</strong> : bibliothèque de patterns d'attaque et de défense, sélectionnés selon le tempo du niveau.","p.beat-strike.c4":"<strong>Boucle de gameplay</strong> : enchaînement des tronçons de niveau, phases d'attaque et de défense, apparition des interactions et déclenchement des combats.","p.heroes-dawn.type":"RPG de gestion","p.heroes-dawn.role":"Conception & développement","p.heroes-dawn.desc":"RPG tactique de gestion dans un monde où les humains sont devenus des méta-humains : exploration sur plateau, combat sur frise, composition d'escouade et gestion du quartier général.","p.heroes-dawn.tagline":"Un RPG mobile où chaque tour se lit sur une timeline.","p.heroes-dawn.meta.role":"Conception & développement","p.heroes-dawn.meta.team":"Projet personnel","p.heroes-dawn.ctx":"Heroes Dawn est un RPG de gestion mobile-first dans l'Apex Universe, l'univers partagé des projets de Studio N29. Une escouade de méta-humains explore New York zone par zone : lancers de dé sur un plateau, combats au tour par tour sur une timeline active et gestion du QG entre les missions. La version actuelle (v0.9.0) propose une campagne de Brooklyn jouable en quatre zones.","p.heroes-dawn.c1":"<strong>Combat au tour par tour</strong> sur une timeline active, avec une synergie d'équipe qui remplace l'ancien système de combos.","p.heroes-dawn.c2":"<strong>Campagne de Brooklyn jouable</strong> : quatre zones (Red Hook, Brownsville, Coney Island, Dumbo et le pont) avec objectifs, ennemis et narration.","p.heroes-dawn.c3":"<strong>Onboarding et progression</strong> : première connexion (cinématique, pseudo narratif, campagne), suivi des quêtes du QG (principales et secondaires) et architecture de comptes prête pour Supabase.","p.heroes-dawn.c4":"<strong>Architecture propre</strong> : code en couches avec interface MVP, package de domaine en C# pur, VContainer, MessagePipe, UniTask et tests EditMode / PlayMode.","p.delight.type":"Aventure 3D","p.delight.role":"Gameplay Programmer","p.delight.desc":"Contrôleur de personnage 3D, IA ennemie par machines à états et architecture audio, sur un projet de groupe Rubika.","p.delight.tagline":"Une aventure 3D construite autour d'un contrôleur fluide et d'ennemis réactifs.","p.delight.meta.role":"Gameplay programming","p.delight.meta.team":"Projet de groupe (Rubika)","p.delight.ctx":"Delight est une aventure 3D réalisée en groupe à Rubika, aujourd'hui terminée. J'y ai architecturé les systèmes de jeu centraux : contrôleur de personnage, IA ennemie et audio. Une migration vers Unity 6 est en cours pour que le projet reste ouvrable et exploitable.","p.delight.c1":"<strong>Contrôleur de personnage 3D</strong> sur mesure, fluide et réactif.","p.delight.c2":"<strong>IA ennemie</strong> par machines à états (FSM), réactive au joueur.","p.delight.c3":"<strong>Architecture audio</strong> et intégration des sons dans le gameplay.","p.delight.c4":"<strong>Intégration des assets 3D</strong> dans les systèmes de jeu.","p.project-x.type":"Confidentiel","p.project-x.role":"Développement Unity","p.project-x.desc":"Un projet en cours de développement, sous accord de confidentialité. Les détails seront publiés après la levée du NDA.","p.project-x.tagline":"Un projet en cours, sous accord de confidentialité.","p.project-x.meta.role":"Développement Unity","p.project-x.meta.team":"Équipe","p.project-x.notice":"Ce projet est couvert par un accord de confidentialité. Je ne peux partager ni visuels, ni nom de client, ni détails techniques précis.","p.project-x.ctx":"Je contribue au développement d'un projet Unity mené en équipe. Ce que je peux en dire : il est en cours de production et je travaille dessus en tant que développeur Unity.","p.project-x.c1":"<strong>Développement de fonctionnalités</strong> en Unity et C#, au sein d'une équipe.","p.project-x.c2":"<strong>Confidentialité stricte</strong> : aucun contenu du projet n'est publié ici.","p.project-x.c3":"<strong>Échange privé possible</strong> : je peux en dire davantage dans le cadre d'une discussion de mission.","pg.back":"Tous les projets","pg.role":"Rôle","pg.engine":"Moteur","pg.team":"Contexte","pg.tech":"Technos","pg.context":"Le projet","pg.contrib":"Ma contribution","pg.next.title":"Un projet similaire ? Parlons-en.","pg.next.cta":"Me contacter","pg.more":"Autres projets","about.eyebrow":"À propos","about.title":"Développeur gameplay, formé à Rubika.","about.p1":"Je suis <strong>développeur Unity</strong>, spécialisé en <strong>programmation gameplay</strong>, systèmes et réseau. J'ai étudié à Rubika (Supinfogame) en Bachelor Programmation, et je travaille aujourd'hui en freelance sous la bannière de <strong>STUDIO N29</strong>.","about.p2":"J'aime les mécaniques qui se sentent bien entre les mains : un combat lisible, un sort qui répond au bon moment, un réseau qui ne se remarque pas. Mes expériences m'ont aussi donné des compétences full-stack web, en LLM / IA et en prompt engineering.","about.p3":"Je m'intègre vite à une équipe, je communique clairement et j'aime livrer du code que d'autres peuvent reprendre.","about.f1.l":"projets présentés","about.f2.l":"langage principal","about.f3.l":"Rubika · Bachelor Programmation","about.f4.n":"Freelance","about.f4.l":"ouvert aux missions","skills.eyebrow":"Compétences","skills.title":"Ce que je peux prendre en charge.","skills.1.t":"Gameplay programming","skills.1.d":"Mécaniques de jeu, combat, sorts et capacités, boucle de jeu, prise en main et game feel.","skills.2.t":"Réseau & multijoueur","skills.2.d":"Architecture réseau, synchronisation d'état, actions répliquées et cohérence entre joueurs.","skills.3.t":"Outils d'éditeur","skills.3.d":"Outils Unity pour les designers : éditeurs de patterns, inspecteurs personnalisés, workflows data-driven.","skills.4.t":"Architecture & systèmes","skills.4.d":"Managers, pooling, sérialisation et chargement de données : un code propre qui tient à l'échelle.","skills.5.t":"Full-stack & IA","skills.5.d":"API back-end, bases de données graphes, intégration de LLM et prompt engineering.","skills.6.t":"Outils & pipeline","skills.6.d":"Git, cloud, 3D (Blender, Unreal) et collaboration avec les équipes art et design.","journey.eyebrow":"Parcours","journey.title":"D'où je viens.","journey.1.date":"Juin 2026 → Janv. 2027","journey.1.t":"Fullstack Developer","journey.1.o":"IdentityOS","journey.1.d":"Création d'une API back-end basée sur l'IA et les bases de données graphes, et d'un jeu narratif sous Unity qui utilise cette API.","journey.2.date":"Août 2024 → Nov. 2025","journey.2.t":"Web Developer","journey.2.o":"Central Cars","journey.2.d":"Site vitrine de véhicules d'occasion avec interface administrateur, et mise en place des outils numériques (cloud, facturation, stock).","journey.3.date":"Mars → Mai 2024","journey.3.t":"Technicien IT","journey.3.o":"Simoldes Plasticos","journey.3.d":"Gestion du matériel hardware et software, et création d'une application de suivi des consommables par scan de QR code.","journey.4.date":"2019 → 2023","journey.4.t":"Bachelor Programmation","journey.4.o":"Rubika — Supinfogame","journey.4.d":"Formation à la programmation de jeux vidéo : gameplay, systèmes et réseau.","contact.eyebrow":"Contact","contact.title":"Un projet ? Parlons gameplay.","contact.lead":"Prototype, renfort d'équipe, système réseau, outil d'éditeur : décrivez votre besoin et nous vous répondons rapidement.","contact.email":"E-mail","contact.web":"Site","contact.where":"Localisation","contact.where.v":"Hauts-de-France · remote possible","form.name":"Nom","form.email":"E-mail","form.topic":"Votre besoin","form.topic.0":"Choisir…","form.topic.1":"Mission freelance","form.topic.2":"Collaboration / projet","form.topic.3":"Autre","form.message":"Message","form.send":"Envoyer le message","form.sending":"Envoi…","form.ok":"Message envoyé. Je vous réponds très vite.","form.err":"Échec de l'envoi. Écrivez-moi directement :","foot.nda":"Project X est soumis à un accord de confidentialité.","p.beat-strike.c5":"<strong>Performance</strong> : pool d'objets pour les interactions, afin d'éviter les allocations en pleine partie.","p.delight.c5":"<strong>Migration vers Unity 6</strong> (en cours) : montée de version, plugins incompatibles et pipeline de rendu.","p.sweet-courrier.type":"Twin stick coop","p.sweet-courrier.role":"Gameplay Engineer","p.sweet-courrier.desc":"Shooter arcade coopératif : physique arcade, inputs multijoueur local et game feel.","p.sweet-courrier.tagline":"Un shooter coopératif où tout se joue au feeling.","p.sweet-courrier.meta.role":"Gameplay engineering","p.sweet-courrier.meta.team":"Projet d'équipe","p.sweet-courrier.ctx":"Sweet Courrier est un shooter arcade coopératif en twin stick. Je me suis concentré sur le game feel : la réactivité des contrôles et la physique dynamique des interactions.","p.sweet-courrier.c1":"<strong>Inputs multijoueur local</strong> : gestion de plusieurs manettes et joueurs sur le même écran.","p.sweet-courrier.c2":"<strong>Physique arcade</strong> : interactions dynamiques et lisibles.","p.sweet-courrier.c3":"<strong>Game feel</strong> : contrôles réactifs, retours visuels et sensations de jeu.","pg.watch":"Voir la vidéo de gameplay","pg.zoom":"Agrandir","lb.close":"Fermer","lb.prev":"Précédent","lb.next":"Suivant","contact.linkedin":"LinkedIn","projects.featured":"Projet phare","nav.reviews":"Avis","p.heroes-dawn.c5":"<strong>Outils de design dans l'éditeur</strong> (fenêtres Unity) pour les objets, compétences, agents et la narration, export CSV pour les tableurs de conception, et outils d'équilibrage (import de tableur et simulateur).","p.heroes-dawn.c6":"<strong>Documentation de production</strong> : GDD, specs de game design, direction artistique, flows UI et roadmap (Early Access Steam, puis mobile) posés avant d'écrire le code.","reviews.eyebrow":"Avis","reviews.title":"Ce que disent mes clients.","reviews.rating":"5.0","reviews.count":"1 avis sur Malt","reviews.cta":"Voir mon profil Malt","reviews.date":"Avis publié le 16/10/2026","reviews.role":"Product Operations Lead, Chukker App LLC","reviews.quote":"Strong all-round contribution across. Djason delivered the first draft of the match simulation algorithms, integrated RP Vision from the GDD with solid stabilisation and performance gains, and set up a clean Unity architecture, Git workflow and documentation. Djason was a reliable partner in production meetings, helping scope and split tasks clearly. Highly recommended for Unity game development.","reviews.note":"Avis tel que publié sur Malt (en anglais).","contact.malt":"Malt","p.n29-hq.type":"Outil interne","p.n29-hq.role":"Conception & développement","p.n29-hq.desc":"L'outil privé avec lequel je gère mon activité freelance : projets, suivi du temps, devis et factures, synchronisation chiffrée.","p.n29-hq.tagline":"Le cockpit privé de mon activité freelance : projets, documents, suivi du temps et facturation dans une seule application installable.","p.n29-hq.meta.role":"Conception et développement","p.n29-hq.meta.team":"Solo, outil interne","p.n29-hq.ctx":"N29 HQ est l'application interne que j'ai conçue pour gérer STUDIO N29 au quotidien. C'est une application web installable (PWA), prioritairement locale, qui fonctionne hors ligne et sur mon téléphone, avec le même style que ce site. Les captures utilisent des données de démonstration fictives.","p.n29-hq.c1":"<strong>Projets et tâches</strong> : plusieurs projets, chacun avec son tableau kanban et ses documents Markdown mis en page visuellement (polices, tailles, styles, tableaux).","p.n29-hq.c2":"<strong>Suivi du temps</strong> : chronomètre et saisie au calendrier avec rapports sur une plage de dates, dans l'esprit de Toggl.","p.n29-hq.c3":"<strong>Devis et factures</strong> conformes aux obligations françaises : numérotation continue, documents émis chaînés par empreinte, avoirs, acomptes.","p.n29-hq.c4":"<strong>Synchronisation chiffrée de bout en bout</strong> : AES-GCM avec phrase secrète, stockée sur Supabase avec sécurité par ligne, fusion à trois voies entre appareils.","p.n29-hq.c5":"<strong>Outils de production</strong> : un générateur de prompts Apex amélioré pour l'illustration.","nav.games":"Jeux","nav.heroes":"Heroes Dawn","nav.studio":"Studio","wish.cta":"Wishlist sur Steam","wish.soon":"Sortie le 15 janvier 2027","foot.tag":"Studio de jeu vidéo indépendant basé dans les Hauts-de-France.","foot.games":"Jeux","foot.all":"Tous les jeux","foot.studio":"Studio","foot.follow":"Contact","page.home.title":"STUDIO N29 — Studio de jeu vidéo indépendant | Heroes Dawn","page.home.desc":"STUDIO N29 est un studio de jeu vidéo indépendant. Heroes Dawn, notre RPG tactique de gestion, sort le 15 janvier 2027 sur Android, iOS et Steam.","page.hd.title":"Heroes Dawn — RPG tactique de gestion | STUDIO N29","page.hd.desc":"Heroes Dawn, RPG tactique de gestion de STUDIO N29 : exploration sur plateau, combat sur frise et composition d'escouade. Sortie le 15 janvier 2027 sur Android, iOS et Steam.","page.games.title":"Jeux — STUDIO N29","page.games.desc":"Tous les jeux et outils de STUDIO N29 : Heroes Dawn, Discosmos, Beat Strike, Delight, Sweet Courrier et plus encore.","page.studio.title":"Le studio — Notre philosophie de design | STUDIO N29","page.studio.desc":"STUDIO N29 est un studio de jeu vidéo indépendant. Découvrez notre façon de concevoir : des choix qui comptent, des jeux lisibles et des mondes qui se répondent.","page.contact.title":"Contact — STUDIO N29","page.contact.desc":"Contactez STUDIO N29 : missions pour éditeurs et entreprises du jeu vidéo, collaborations, presse et actualités de Heroes Dawn.","h.feat.eyebrow":"Jeu à l'honneur","h.feat.sub":"Un RPG tactique de gestion dans un monde où les humains sont devenus des méta-humains.","h.feat.cta2":"Découvrir le jeu","h.feat.text":"Dirigez une escouade de méta-humains : explorez un plateau qui se dévoile au fil de vos pas, combinez les pouvoirs de vos agents sur la frise de combat et gérez le quartier général de The Dawn entre deux missions.","h.pillars.eyebrow":"Le jeu","h.pillars.title":"Lisez chaque tour. Préparez chaque mission.","h.p1.t":"Un combat sur timeline active","h.p1.d":"Chaque action a un coût et une place sur la timeline. Interrompez, parez, combinez les compétences — et voyez le prochain coup de vos ennemis avant qu'ils le portent.","h.p2.t":"Explorez le plateau","h.p2.d":"Lancez les dés et choisissez votre chemin dans chaque zone : combats, ressources, événements et objectifs, avec un budget de temps qui impose de vrais choix.","h.p3.t":"Gérez votre QG","h.p3.d":"Entre deux missions, gérez vos agents, votre grimoire de cartes de compétence, l'équipement et les quêtes. Chaque amélioration change la façon de jouer de votre escouade.","h.shots.eyebrow":"En jeu","h.shots.title":"Directement de la dernière version.","h.shots.cta":"Voir toutes les captures","h.studio.eyebrow":"Le studio","h.studio.title":"Des jeux dont on ressent le gameplay.","h.studio.text":"STUDIO N29 est un studio de jeu vidéo indépendant basé dans les Hauts-de-France. Nous créons des jeux Unity autour de mécaniques lisibles et réactives, et les outils et systèmes qui les rendent possibles.","h.studio.cta":"Découvrir le studio","h.f1":"projets","h.f2":"moteur principal","h.f3":"univers partagé","h.f4":"langues du studio","h.games.eyebrow":"Portfolio","h.games.title":"Aussi au studio.","h.games.cta":"Tous les jeux","h.work.eyebrow":"Travailler avec nous","h.work.title":"Besoin d'une équipe gameplay ?","h.work.lead":"Prototype, renfort d'équipe, multijoueur, outils d'éditeur : le studio prend des missions pour des éditeurs et des entreprises du jeu vidéo.","h.work.cta":"Démarrer un projet","h.s1.t":"Gameplay & systèmes","h.s1.d":"Mécaniques, combat, capacités et game feel, conçus pour être lus, réglés et étendus par les game designers.","h.s2.t":"Multijoueur & réseau","h.s2.d":"Netcode synchrone, réplication d'état et compensation de latence, éprouvés sur un MOBA 3D compétitif.","h.s3.t":"Outils & pipeline","h.s3.d":"Outils d'éditeur Unity, workflows pilotés par la donnée et architecture propre, pour que votre équipe livre plus vite.","hd.cap.combat":"Combat au tour par tour sur la timeline active","hd.cap.combat2":"Lancement d'une compétence en combat","hd.cap.board":"Exploration du plateau à Red Hook","hd.cap.fog":"Brouillard de guerre et objectifs de zone","hd.cap.hq":"Le QG à New York","hd.cap.team":"Composition de l'escouade et synergies","hd.cap.sheet":"Fiche d'agent : compétences et équipement","hd.cap.grimoire":"Le grimoire des cartes de compétence","hd.cap.chapters":"Chapitres de la campagne","hd.cap.dialogue":"Choix narratifs","hd.cap.minigame":"Mini-jeu de rythme","hd.cap.quests":"Journal de quêtes","hd.cap.shop":"Boutique et boosters de cartes","hd.cap.roster":"Registre des agents","hd.hero.eyebrow":"STUDIO N29 présente","hd.hero.tag":"Un RPG tactique de gestion dans un monde où les humains sont devenus des méta-humains.","hd.hero.cta2":"Captures","hd.m.genre":"Genre","hd.m.genre.v":"RPG tactique de gestion","hd.m.platform":"Plateformes","hd.m.platform.v":"Android, iOS et Steam","hd.m.engine":"Moteur","hd.m.status":"Sortie","hd.m.status.v":"15 janvier 2027","hd.about.eyebrow":"Le jeu","hd.about.title":"Une escouade. Un monde qui a basculé. Un choix à la fois.","hd.about.p1":"Cinq ans après la Supernova de Paris, des humains sont devenus des méta-humains : leurs pouvoirs s'éveillent et le monde oscille entre peur, fascination et espoir. Rejoignez The Dawn, une organisation qui protège les méta-humains et les civils dans l'Apex Universe, préparez votre escouade et mobilisez les pouvoirs de vos agents pour surmonter chaque obstacle.","hd.about.p2":"Chaque mission commence par un choix : votre route sur le plateau, les agents à recruter, la préparation de la prochaine sortie au quartier général. Heroes Dawn sort le 15 janvier 2027 sur Android, iOS et Steam.","hd.f1.t":"Un combat sur frise","hd.f1.d":"Suivez la frise de combat, gérez l'énergie de vos agents et utilisez leurs cartes de compétence. Attaquer, protéger ou soutenir : chaque décision participe à l'équilibre de l'escouade.","hd.f2.t":"Un plateau qui se dévoile","hd.f2.d":"Lancez le dé pour obtenir des points de mouvement, observez les chemins accessibles et choisissez votre destination. Le brouillard masque la suite : avancez pour découvrir rencontres, combats et objectifs.","hd.f3.t":"Construisez votre escouade","hd.f3.d":"Recrutez des agents aux capacités différentes, composez votre équipe et recherchez les synergies entre ses membres. Préparez leurs compétences et leur équipement pour donner une direction à votre stratégie.","hd.f4.t":"Le QG, votre point d'appui","hd.f4.d":"Entre deux sorties, retrouvez votre équipe, consultez les missions, fabriquez de l'équipement et organisez vos expéditions. La préparation fait partie de l'aventure.","hd.f5.t":"Une campagne qui commence à New York","hd.f5.d":"Choisissez votre mission sur la carte, suivez les objectifs de chaque zone et débloquez les suivantes au fil de la campagne.","hd.f6.t":"Mini-jeux","hd.f6.d":"Rythme, infiltration, ingénierie et survie : des défis qui rythment les missions et récompensent l'escouade.","hd.gal.eyebrow":"Captures","hd.gal.title":"La dernière version.","hd.gal.lead":"Captures en jeu. Cliquez sur une image pour l'agrandir.","hd.art.eyebrow":"Art","hd.art.title":"Les agents.","hd.art.lead":"Illustrations des personnages issues de la production.","hd.road.eyebrow":"Feuille de route","hd.road.title":"Où va le jeu.","hd.road.lead":"De la version actuelle au jour du lancement.","hd.road.1.s":"Maintenant","hd.road.1.t":"Version 1.0.2","hd.road.1.d":"Une campagne jouable avec exploration, combat, quartier général, quêtes et l'interface tactique repensée.","hd.road.2.s":"15 janvier 2027","hd.road.2.t":"Lancement","hd.road.2.d":"Heroes Dawn sort sur Android, iOS et Steam.","hd.road.3.s":"Puis","hd.road.3.t":"Sortie Android","hd.road.3.d":"Une version Android existe déjà et l'interface est pensée tactile ; la sortie sur Google Play suit.","hd.tech.eyebrow":"Sous le capot","hd.tech.title":"Conçu pour durer.","hd.tech.p":"Heroes Dawn est développé sous <strong>Unity 6</strong> avec une <strong>architecture propre</strong> en couches : interface MVP, package de domaine en C# pur, injection de dépendances et tests EditMode / PlayMode. Des outils dans l'éditeur permettent de créer objets, compétences, agents et narration, et d'équilibrer le jeu depuis des tableurs.","hd.cta.eyebrow":"Sortie le 15 janvier 2027","hd.cta.title":"Rejoignez l'escouade.","hd.cta.lead":"Heroes Dawn sort sur Android, iOS et Steam. Ajoutez-le à votre wishlist Steam pour être prévenu le jour du lancement.","hd.cta.press":"Presse & contact","g.eyebrow":"Portfolio","g.title":"Nos jeux.","g.lead":"Réseau, sorts, rythme, contrôleurs, systèmes de combat : chaque projet, et ce que nous y avons construit.","g.f.all":"Tout","g.f.game":"Jeux","g.f.tool":"Outils & apps","s.eyebrow":"Le studio","s.title":"Des jeux conçus autour des choix du joueur.","s.lead":"STUDIO N29 est un studio indépendant. Nous partons de l'expérience que nous voulons faire vivre au joueur, puis nous façonnons chaque système, chaque écran et chaque monde autour d'elle.","s.v1.t":"Le ressenti d'abord","s.v1.d":"Une mécanique est terminée quand elle est agréable en main, pas quand elle compile.","s.v2.t":"Un code lisible","s.v2.d":"Une architecture propre et des outils pour qu'une équipe entière reprenne un projet et le fasse évoluer.","s.v3.t":"De petites boucles","s.v3.d":"Prototyper vite, itérer souvent et garder le jeu jouable à chaque étape.","s.apex.eyebrow":"L'univers","s.apex.title":"Un univers, plusieurs jeux.","s.apex.p1":"L'univers Apex est l'univers partagé des projets de STUDIO N29 : des personnages, des factions et des lieux qui se retrouvent d'un jeu à l'autre.","s.apex.p2":"Heroes Dawn en est le premier grand chapitre, dans un monde où les humains sont devenus des méta-humains. Un nouveau projet, Hell Rising, vient d'entrer en conception.","s.exp.title":"Ce que le studio prend en charge.","s.founder.eyebrow":"Derrière le studio","s.founder.title":"Fondé par Djason Nathiez.","s.founder.p1":"STUDIO N29 est dirigé par <strong>Djason Nathiez</strong>, formé à Rubika (Supinfogame), qui conçoit et développe les jeux du studio.","s.founder.p2":"Il aime les mécaniques agréables en main et les jeux qui respectent le temps du joueur : un combat lisible, des choix qui comptent, pas de remplissage.","nav.portfolio":"Portfolio","foot.rights":"Tous droits réservés.","sub.overview":"Présentation","sub.gameplay":"Gameplay","sub.agents":"Personnages","sub.screens":"Captures","sub.roadmap":"Feuille de route","dock.1.s":"Sortie le 15 janvier 2027","dock.1.t":"Heroes Dawn","dock.2.s":"Nouveau projet","dock.2.t":"Hell Rising","dock.3.s":"Le studio","dock.3.t":"Découvrir STUDIO N29","h.agents.eyebrow":"Les agents","h.agents.title":"Les agents de The Dawn.","h.agents.lead":"Illustrations du jeu : des humains éveillés après la Supernova de Paris, et les cryptides de Salem. Tous sont des agents de The Dawn.","h.apex.cta":"Découvrir l'univers","hd.feat.eyebrow":"Gameplay","hd.feat.title":"Comment on y joue.","s.val.eyebrow":"Notre approche","s.val.title":"Ce en quoi nous croyons.","s.team.eyebrow":"L'équipe","s.team.title":"Derrière le studio.","s.founder.name":"Djason Nathiez","s.founder.cta":"Voir le portfolio","page.portfolio.title":"Portfolio — Djason Nathiez, programmeur gameplay Unity | STUDIO N29","page.portfolio.desc":"Portfolio de Djason Nathiez, programmeur gameplay Unity et fondateur de STUDIO N29 : Discosmos, Beat Strike, Delight, Heroes Dawn et plus encore.","pf.eyebrow":"Portfolio","pf.title":"Djason Nathiez, programmeur gameplay Unity.","pf.lead":"Une sélection de jeux et d'outils réalisés par le fondateur de STUDIO N29 : réseau, sorts, moteurs de rythme, contrôleurs et outils d'éditeur. Pour chaque projet : ce que j'y ai réellement fait.","pf.cta":"Travailler ensemble","pf.projects":"Projets","pf.skills":"Compétences","pf.journey":"Parcours","pf.reviews":"Avis clients","c.eyebrow":"Contact","c.title":"Parlons-en.","c.lead":"Une mission, une collaboration, une demande presse ou une simple question sur Heroes Dawn : écrivez-nous.","c.pro.title":"Éditeurs & clients","c.players.title":"Joueurs","c.players.d":"Heroes Dawn sort le 15 janvier 2027 sur Android, iOS et Steam. Les liens des boutiques apparaîtront ici et sur la page du jeu dès que les pages seront en ligne.","hd.cap.missions":"Choix d'une mission sur la carte de New York","hd.cap.recruit":"Recrutement de nouveaux agents","hd.cap.craft":"Fabrication d'équipement au QG","hd.cap.expeditions":"Organisation des expéditions","hd.cap.stealth":"Mini-jeu d'infiltration","hd.cap.pass":"Pass de saison et activités du jour","hd.art.agent":"Agent","hd.art.cryptid":"Cryptide","hr.eyebrow":"Nouveau projet · Début de conception","hr.tag":"Un jeu d'action dans les Enfers de l'Apex Universe. Le projet vient de démarrer : il est trop tôt pour en dire plus, mais nous y travaillons déjà.","hr.c1":"Action narrative","hr.c2":"Solo · 3D","hr.c3":"Apex Universe","hr.cta":"Découvrir le projet","page.hr.title":"Hell Rising — Un nouveau projet de STUDIO N29","page.hr.desc":"Hell Rising est le nouveau projet de STUDIO N29 : un jeu d'action narratif dans les Enfers de l'Apex Universe. La conception vient de commencer.","hr.p.eyebrow":"Le projet","hr.p.title":"Ce que nous pouvons dire pour l'instant.","hr.p.lead":"La conception a débuté en novembre 2026. Tout ce qui suit est une intention, pas une promesse.","hr.i1.t":"Un combat fluide et puissant","hr.i1.d":"Frappes, feu et déplacements enchaînés : le jeu doit être agréable en main dès la première minute.","hr.i2.t":"Des Enfers à découvrir","hr.i2.d":"Un monde avec des habitants et des histoires qui dépassent la quête principale.","hr.i3.t":"Une histoire concentrée","hr.i3.d":"Une aventure resserrée, enrichie de détours qui comptent.","hr.v.eyebrow":"Premier aperçu","hr.v.title":"Une ambiance, pas une promesse.","hr.v.lead":"Premiers concepts qui posent le ton. Rien ici n'est définitif.","hr.cap1":"Concept art — une plaine en ruines dans les Enfers","hr.cap2":"Concept art — vue de jeu indicative","hr.note":"Concept art réalisé pendant la phase pilote de la direction artistique. Le gameplay, les personnages et l'histoire sont encore en cours de définition.","hr.follow":"Envie de suivre le projet ?","hr.follow.cta":"Nous contacter","hd.release.line":"15 janvier 2027 · Android · iOS · Steam","s.manifesto":"Un bon jeu donne des décisions qui comptent, dans un monde où l'on a envie de rester.","s.phil.eyebrow":"Philosophie de design","s.phil.title":"Comment nous concevons.","s.p1.t":"Le choix au centre","s.p1.d":"Chaque mission commence par un choix. Nous concevons des décisions que le joueur peut lire, peser et assumer, plutôt que de simples réflexes.","s.p2.t":"Lisible avant tout","s.p2.d":"Le joueur doit toujours comprendre ce qui se passe et pourquoi. L'information claire et l'interface sobre passent avant le spectacle.","s.p3.t":"Le ressenti d'abord","s.p3.d":"Une mécanique est terminée quand elle est agréable en main, pas seulement quand elle fonctionne. Nous itérons jusqu'à ce que la sensation y soit.","s.p4.t":"Des personnages qui comptent","s.p4.d":"Les héros ne sont pas des silhouettes : chacun a ses pouvoirs et sa propre histoire.","s.p5.t":"Des mondes qui se répondent","s.p5.d":"Nos jeux partagent un même univers, l'Apex Universe. Personnages, factions et lieux voyagent d'un jeu à l'autre.","s.p6.t":"Resserré plutôt que long","s.p6.d":"Nous préférons une aventure concentrée, avec des détours qui comptent, au remplissage. Chaque heure doit mériter sa place.","s.prac.eyebrow":"En pratique","s.prac.title":"La philosophie, dans nos jeux.","s.hd.eyebrow":"Dans Heroes Dawn","s.hd.title":"Des choix lisibles.","s.hd.text":"La frise de combat montre qui agit ensuite : chaque décision se prend en connaissance de cause. Entre deux missions, le quartier général fait de la préparation une part du jeu.","s.hr.eyebrow":"Dans Hell Rising","s.hr.title":"Une puissance agréable à ressentir.","s.hr.text":"Notre nouveau projet part de la sensation : un combat fluide et puissant, une histoire concentrée. Il est trop tôt pour en dire plus.","sub.lore":"Le monde","s.apex.lore":"Comprendre le lore","lore.eyebrow":"Le monde","lore.title":"Le monde en bref.","lore.lead":"Heroes Dawn se déroule dans l'Apex Universe, l'univers partagé des jeux de STUDIO N29. Voici l'essentiel à savoir avant de rejoindre The Dawn.","lore.t1.y":"1981","lore.t1.t":"L'Apex Unit","lore.t1.d":"En pleine guerre froide, les États-Unis créent l'Apex Unit : les tout premiers méta-humains.","lore.t2.y":"2026","lore.t2.t":"La Supernova de Paris","lore.t2.d":"Une nuit, un phénomène frappe Paris. Partout dans le monde, des gènes sont modifiés. Pour la plupart, rien ne change ; chez certains, un pouvoir sommeille.","lore.t3.y":"5 ans plus tard","lore.t3.t":"Heroes Dawn","lore.t3.d":"Les pouvoirs s'éveillent après un choc brutal. Le monde oscille entre peur, fascination et espoir, et les institutions cherchent à contrôler les méta-humains. Vous rejoignez The Dawn.","lore.c1.t":"The Dawn","lore.c1.d":"Une organisation fondée par des méta-humains qui ont décidé de ne pas se cacher. Son symbole est une étoile dorée à quatre branches. Elle protège les méta-humains et les civils.","lore.c2.t":"L'AMIF","lore.c2.d":"Une agence qui prétend encadrer les méta-humains pour leur sécurité, mais qui étudie et prélève leurs capacités. La principale menace officielle de The Dawn.","lore.c3.t":"Les Apex","lore.c3.d":"Le surnom courant des méta-humains, tiré de l'Apex Unit d'origine. Le terme officiel reste « méta-humain ».","sub.alpha":"Alpha","alpha.eyebrow":"Alpha Android","alpha.title":"Rejoignez l'Alpha.","alpha.lead":"Essayez Heroes Dawn sur Android avant tout le monde. Inscrivez-vous avec l'adresse e-mail de votre compte Google et nous vous inviterons à l'Alpha sur Google Play.","alpha.note":"Utilisez l'adresse liée à votre compte Google Play : c'est celle qui recevra l'invitation.","alpha.email":"E-mail de votre compte Google","alpha.placeholder":"vous@gmail.com","alpha.consent":"J'accepte que STUDIO N29 conserve mon adresse e-mail pour m'inviter à l'Alpha de Heroes Dawn. Je peux demander sa suppression à tout moment.","alpha.submit":"M'inscrire à l'Alpha","alpha.cta":"Rejoindre l'Alpha Android","alpha.sending":"Envoi…","alpha.ok":"Vous êtes sur la liste ! Votre invitation vous sera envoyée par e-mail.","alpha.bad":"Veuillez saisir une adresse e-mail valide.","alpha.noconsent":"Veuillez cocher la case pour continuer.","alpha.err":"L'inscription a échoué. Réessayez, ou écrivez-nous :","alpha.privacy":"Votre adresse sert uniquement à vous inviter à l'Alpha.","ag.agent-d.t":"L'imagination matérialisée","ag.agent-d.d":"Matérialise ce que son esprit image : objets, structures, créatures temporaires.","ag.darius-brooks.t":"Matière animée","ag.darius-brooks.d":"Anime et contrôle les objets non organiques : métal, pierre, bois, mobilier.","ag.mei-lin-chen.t":"Maîtrise du feu","ag.mei-lin-chen.d":"Crée, dirige et étouffe les flammes.","ag.kwame-abara.t":"Métamorphose animale","ag.kwame-abara.d":"Se transforme partiellement ou totalement en animal (crocodile, lion, rapace, etc.).","ag.noah-kaplan.t":"Transposition","ag.noah-kaplan.d":"Échange sa position avec un objet ou une personne à portée de vue.","ag.freya-lindqvist.t":"Télépathie","ag.freya-lindqvist.d":"Lit et transmet les pensées, communique à distance par la pensée.","ag.giulia-rossi.t":"Télékinésie","ag.giulia-rossi.d":"Déplace, soulève et projette des objets par la pensée.","ag.tunde-oyelaran.t":"Poches dimensionnelles","ag.tunde-oyelaran.d":"Crée des espaces dimensionnels temporaires ou permanents pour stocker, cacher ou piéger.","ag.lucas-mendes.t":"Intangibilité","ag.lucas-mendes.d":"Rend son corps traversable par la matière, sans pouvoir frapper ni être frappé.","ag.rin-takeda.t":"Ondes électromagnétiques","ag.rin-takeda.d":"Émet, capte, brouille et manipule les ondes électromagnétiques (radio, Wi-Fi, électricité).","ag.amara-hughes.t":"Résonance émotionnelle","ag.amara-hughes.d":"Perçoit et influence les émotions des foules ou des individus, pour apaiser, exciter ou concentrer.","ag.ilona-varga.t":"Matérialisation des peurs","ag.ilona-varga.d":"Donne une forme physique et tangible aux peurs de ses cibles.","ag.louis-dubois.t":"Champs magnétiques","ag.louis-dubois.d":"Crée et contrôle des champs magnétiques, attire ou repousse le métal et les objets chargés.","ag.ada-okonkwo.t":"Biokinésie","ag.ada-okonkwo.d":"Manipule l'ADN des êtres vivants : soigner, muter, accélérer ou ralentir des processus biologiques.","ag.victor-sorel.t":"Contrôle mental","ag.victor-sorel.d":"Prend le contrôle de l'esprit de ses cibles pour un temps limité.","ag.fatou-diallo.t":"Énergie cinétique","ag.fatou-diallo.d":"Transforme son énergie cinétique en projectiles, boucliers et barrières.","ag.clement-lefevre.t":"Illusions","ag.clement-lefevre.d":"Crée des illusions visuelles et sonores qui trompent les sens de ses cibles.","ag.youssef-haddad.t":"Sens décuplés","ag.youssef-haddad.d":"Décuple ses sens (vue, ouïe, odorat, toucher et « sixième sens »).","ag.marco-bellini.t":"Alchimie de contact","ag.marco-bellini.d":"Transforme la composition d'un objet ou d'une matière par simple contact.","ag.severine-morel.t":"Vampirisme vital","ag.severine-morel.d":"Absorbe l'énergie vitale de ses cibles pour se soigner ou se renforcer.","ag.ji-hoon-park.t":"Invisibilité","ag.ji-hoon-park.d":"Rend son corps et son équipement invisibles à la vue, sans effacer les sons ni les odeurs.","ag.agent-m.t":"La vision du temps","ag.agent-m.d":"Perçoit le passé, le présent et le futur de ce qui l'entoure.","ag.sam-okafor.t":"Absorption cinétique","ag.sam-okafor.d":"Absorbe les coups et l'énergie cinétique, puis la redistribue en une onde de choc ou un surcroît de force.","ag.astrid-hallstrom.t":"Maîtrise de l'eau","ag.astrid-hallstrom.d":"Manipule l'eau sous toutes ses formes, de la pluie à la vapeur.","ag.celeste-moreau.t":"Production de gaz","ag.celeste-moreau.d":"Produit et répand des gaz aux effets variés : toxiques, anesthésiants ou euphorisants.","ag.anna-petrov.t":"Téléportation","ag.anna-petrov.d":"Se téléporte sur de courtes et moyennes distances, vers des points qu'elle connaît.","ag.haruto-nakamura.t":"Projection astrale","ag.haruto-nakamura.d":"Sépare son esprit de son corps pour explorer, espionner ou agir à distance.","ag.eero-nieminen.t":"Gravité","ag.eero-nieminen.d":"Augmente ou diminue localement la gravité, pour écraser ses cibles ou se déplacer dans les airs.","ag.mateo-vasquez.t":"Maîtrise du sang","ag.mateo-vasquez.d":"Contrôle le sang de ses cibles ou du sien : arrêter une hémorragie, provoquer une coagulation, ou faire saigner.","ag.zofia-kowalczyk.t":"Maîtrise du son","ag.zofia-kowalczyk.d":"Crée, amplifie, déforme ou annule les sons. Peut produire des ondes destructrices.","ag.odile-ferrand.t":"Dilatation du temps","ag.odile-ferrand.d":"Ralentit ou accélère le temps dans une zone limitée autour d'elle.","ag.yelena-ivanova.t":"Cryokinésie","ag.yelena-ivanova.d":"Crée et contrôle la glace et le froid intense : gel, cristaux, barrières.","ag.kraken.t":"Cryptide marin","ag.kraken.d":"Tentacules capables de saisir, d'écraser et de projeter. Perception des vibrations dans l'eau et dans le sol.","ag.mante.t":"Cryptide volant","ag.mante.d":"Lames d'énergie sur les avant-bras, vol court sur ailes translucides, réflexes accrus.","ag.caprin.t":"Cryptide terrestre","ag.caprin.d":"Fait léviter et déplace les roches et les cristaux. Force physique élevée.","ag.phalene.t":"Cryptide ailé nocturne","ag.phalene.d":"Vol silencieux, vision nocturne parfaite, attire et concentre la lumière autour de lui pour éblouir.","ag.famine.t":"Cryptide hivernal","ag.famine.d":"Absorbe la chaleur des êtres vivants. Plus il a faim, plus il grandit et sa peau se durcit.","ag.pied-grand.t":"Cryptide forestier","ag.pied-grand.d":"Force colossale, sauts de grande hauteur, frappe au sol qui provoque de petites secousses.","ag.lupin.t":"Cryptide lycanthrope","ag.lupin.d":"Transformation partielle ou complète en chien-loup. Odorat extrême, morsures puissantes.","ag.pierre.t":"Cryptide statuaire","ag.pierre.d":"Peau de pierre résistante aux impacts. Se fige en statue pour éviter les coups. Ailes de roche pour planer brièvement.","ag.suceur.t":"Cryptide prédateur","ag.suceur.d":"Course très rapide sur quatre pattes, mâchoires à crocs rétractiles, odorat qui perçoit le sang à plusieurs kilomètres.","zone.ny":"New York","zone.paris":"Paris","zone.moscow":"Moscou","zone.salem":"Salem","zone.all":"Tous"},"en":{"meta.title":"Djason Nathiez — Freelance Unity Gameplay Developer | STUDIO N29","meta.description":"Portfolio of Djason Nathiez, freelance Unity developer specialised in gameplay programming, systems and multiplayer networking. Projects: Discosmos, Beat Strike, Heroes Dawn, Delight.","meta.title.project":"{name} — Game | STUDIO N29","nav.projects":"Projects","nav.about":"About","nav.skills":"Skills","nav.journey":"Journey","nav.contact":"Contact","nav.cta":"Get in touch","nav.menu":"Menu","skip":"Skip to content","hero.status":"Available for freelance missions","hero.l1":"Gameplay","hero.l2":"you can <span class=\"accent\">feel.</span>","hero.role":"<strong>Djason Nathiez</strong> — Unity Gameplay Programmer","hero.lead":"Freelance Unity developer specialised in gameplay, systems and networking. I turn a design intention into solid, readable mechanics that feel great to play.","hero.cta1":"See the projects","hero.cta2":"Get in touch","hero.scroll":"Scroll","projects.eyebrow":"Projects","projects.title":"What I've built.","projects.lead":"Networking, spells, rhythm, controllers, combat systems. For each project: what I actually did.","projects.view":"View project","status.wip":"In progress","status.nda":"NDA","p.discosmos.type":"3D MOBA · 2 months","p.discosmos.role":"Lead Network & Skills","p.discosmos.desc":"Synchronous network infrastructure and skill architecture for a competitive 3D MOBA built in two months.","p.discosmos.tagline":"A 3D MOBA built in two months, where netcode makes all the difference.","p.discosmos.meta.role":"Lead Network & Skills","p.discosmos.meta.team":"Team project · 2 months","p.discosmos.ctx":"Discosmos is a competitive 3D MOBA built in two months in Unity with Photon. I set up the entire synchronous network infrastructure and the skill architecture, aiming for the lowest possible latency so every match stays fair and readable.","p.discosmos.c1":"<strong>Synchronous netcode</strong>: connection, rooms, player management and game-state synchronisation with Photon.","p.discosmos.c2":"<strong>Latency</strong>: optimisation and lag compensation to keep actions responsive between players.","p.discosmos.c3":"<strong>Skill system</strong>: architecture of the characters' abilities, casting and applying effects, replicated over the network.","p.discosmos.c4":"<strong>Extensible code</strong>: structured so the team can add skills without touching the network layer.","p.beat-strike.type":"Mobile rhythm","p.beat-strike.role":"Rhythm engine & editor tool","p.beat-strike.desc":"High-precision mobile rhythm engine, main gameplay loop and a Unity tool to compose patterns.","p.beat-strike.tagline":"A mobile rhythm game where every strike is played on the beat.","p.beat-strike.meta.role":"Core dev & tooling","p.beat-strike.meta.team":"Team project","p.beat-strike.ctx":"In Beat Strike the level scrolls, enemies show up and the player chains tempo-synced interactions to attack and dodge. I developed the rhythm engine, the main gameplay loop and a Unity tool (Capacity Tool) to compose patterns in real time.","p.beat-strike.c1":"<strong>High-precision rhythm engine</strong>, designed to stay accurate on mobile.","p.beat-strike.c2":"<strong>Capacity Tool</strong>: a Unity editor with a timeline (BPM, duration, interaction type: attack, up / down dodge…) that designers can use without touching code.","p.beat-strike.c3":"<strong>Patterns per BPM</strong>: a library of attack and defence patterns, picked according to the level's tempo.","p.beat-strike.c4":"<strong>Gameplay loop</strong>: level chunk sequencing, attack and defence phases, interaction spawning and combat triggering.","p.heroes-dawn.type":"Management RPG","p.heroes-dawn.role":"Design & development","p.heroes-dawn.desc":"A tactical management RPG in a world where humans have become metahumans: board exploration, combat on a timeline, squad building and headquarters management.","p.heroes-dawn.tagline":"A mobile RPG where every turn is read on a timeline.","p.heroes-dawn.meta.role":"Design & development","p.heroes-dawn.meta.team":"Personal project","p.heroes-dawn.ctx":"Heroes Dawn is a mobile-first management RPG set in the Apex Universe, the shared universe of Studio N29's projects. A squad of meta-humans explores New York zone by zone: rolling dice across a board, fighting turn-based battles on an active timeline and managing their HQ between missions. The current build (v0.9.0) offers a playable Brooklyn campaign in four zones.","p.heroes-dawn.c1":"<strong>Turn-based combat</strong> on an active timeline, with team synergy replacing the former combo system.","p.heroes-dawn.c2":"<strong>Playable Brooklyn campaign</strong>: four zones (Red Hook, Brownsville, Coney Island, Dumbo and the bridge) with objectives, enemies and narration.","p.heroes-dawn.c3":"<strong>Onboarding and progression</strong>: first-login flow (cinematic, narrative nickname, campaign), HQ quest tracking (main and side quests) and an account architecture ready for Supabase.","p.heroes-dawn.c4":"<strong>Clean architecture</strong>: layered code with an MVP interface, a pure-C# domain package, VContainer, MessagePipe, UniTask and EditMode / PlayMode tests.","p.delight.type":"3D adventure","p.delight.role":"Gameplay Programmer","p.delight.desc":"3D character controller, state-machine enemy AI and audio architecture, on a Rubika group project.","p.delight.tagline":"A 3D adventure built around a fluid controller and reactive enemies.","p.delight.meta.role":"Gameplay programming","p.delight.meta.team":"Group project (Rubika)","p.delight.ctx":"Delight is a 3D adventure made in a group at Rubika, now completed. I architected the core game systems: character controller, enemy AI and audio. A migration to Unity 6 is under way so the project stays openable and usable.","p.delight.c1":"<strong>Custom 3D character controller</strong>, fluid and responsive.","p.delight.c2":"<strong>Enemy AI</strong> driven by finite state machines (FSM), reactive to the player.","p.delight.c3":"<strong>Audio architecture</strong> and integration of sound into gameplay.","p.delight.c4":"<strong>3D asset integration</strong> into the game systems.","p.project-x.type":"Confidential","p.project-x.role":"Unity development","p.project-x.desc":"A project in development, under a non-disclosure agreement. Details will be published once the NDA is lifted.","p.project-x.tagline":"A project in progress, under a non-disclosure agreement.","p.project-x.meta.role":"Unity development","p.project-x.meta.team":"Team","p.project-x.notice":"This project is covered by a non-disclosure agreement. I can't share visuals, client names or precise technical details.","p.project-x.ctx":"I contribute to the development of a Unity project built by a team. What I can say: it is in production and I work on it as a Unity developer.","p.project-x.c1":"<strong>Feature development</strong> in Unity and C#, within a team.","p.project-x.c2":"<strong>Strict confidentiality</strong>: no project content is published here.","p.project-x.c3":"<strong>Private discussion possible</strong>: I can say more as part of a mission discussion.","pg.back":"All projects","pg.role":"Role","pg.engine":"Engine","pg.team":"Context","pg.tech":"Tech","pg.context":"The project","pg.contrib":"My contribution","pg.next.title":"A similar project? Let's talk.","pg.next.cta":"Get in touch","pg.more":"Other projects","about.eyebrow":"About","about.title":"Gameplay developer, trained at Rubika.","about.p1":"I'm a <strong>Unity developer</strong> specialised in <strong>gameplay programming</strong>, systems and networking. I studied at Rubika (Supinfogame) in the Programming Bachelor, and I now work as a freelancer under the <strong>STUDIO N29</strong> banner.","about.p2":"I like mechanics that feel good in the hands: readable combat, a spell that responds at the right moment, networking you never notice. My experience also gave me full-stack web, LLM / AI and prompt-engineering skills.","about.p3":"I fit into a team quickly, communicate clearly and like shipping code that others can pick up.","about.f1.l":"projects featured","about.f2.l":"main language","about.f3.l":"Rubika · Programming Bachelor","about.f4.n":"Freelance","about.f4.l":"open to missions","skills.eyebrow":"Skills","skills.title":"What I can take on.","skills.1.t":"Gameplay programming","skills.1.d":"Game mechanics, combat, spells and abilities, game loop, controls and game feel.","skills.2.t":"Networking & multiplayer","skills.2.d":"Network architecture, state synchronisation, replicated actions and consistency between players.","skills.3.t":"Editor tools","skills.3.d":"Unity tools for designers: pattern editors, custom inspectors, data-driven workflows.","skills.4.t":"Architecture & systems","skills.4.d":"Managers, pooling, serialisation and data loading: clean code that scales.","skills.5.t":"Full-stack & AI","skills.5.d":"Back-end APIs, graph databases, LLM integration and prompt engineering.","skills.6.t":"Tools & pipeline","skills.6.d":"Git, cloud, 3D (Blender, Unreal) and collaboration with art and design teams.","journey.eyebrow":"Journey","journey.title":"Where I come from.","journey.1.date":"Jun 2026 → Jan 2027","journey.1.t":"Fullstack Developer","journey.1.o":"IdentityOS","journey.1.d":"Built an AI-based back-end API on graph databases, and a narrative game in Unity that uses this API.","journey.2.date":"Aug 2024 → Nov 2025","journey.2.t":"Web Developer","journey.2.o":"Central Cars","journey.2.d":"Showcase website for used vehicles with an admin interface, and setup of the digital tools (cloud, invoicing, stock).","journey.3.date":"Mar → May 2024","journey.3.t":"IT Technician","journey.3.o":"Simoldes Plasticos","journey.3.d":"Hardware and software maintenance, and a consumables tracking app based on QR-code scanning.","journey.4.date":"2019 → 2023","journey.4.t":"Programming Bachelor","journey.4.o":"Rubika — Supinfogame","journey.4.d":"Video game programming studies: gameplay, systems and networking.","contact.eyebrow":"Contact","contact.title":"A project? Let's talk gameplay.","contact.lead":"Prototype, team reinforcement, networking system, editor tool: describe your need and we'll get back to you quickly.","contact.email":"Email","contact.web":"Website","contact.where":"Location","contact.where.v":"Hauts-de-France, France · remote friendly","form.name":"Name","form.email":"Email","form.topic":"Your need","form.topic.0":"Choose…","form.topic.1":"Freelance mission","form.topic.2":"Collaboration / project","form.topic.3":"Other","form.message":"Message","form.send":"Send message","form.sending":"Sending…","form.ok":"Message sent. I'll reply very soon.","form.err":"Sending failed. Please email me directly:","foot.nda":"Project X is under a non-disclosure agreement.","p.beat-strike.c5":"<strong>Performance</strong>: object pooling for interactions to avoid allocations during play.","p.delight.c5":"<strong>Unity 6 migration</strong> (ongoing): version upgrade, incompatible plugins and render pipeline.","p.sweet-courrier.type":"Twin stick co-op","p.sweet-courrier.role":"Gameplay Engineer","p.sweet-courrier.desc":"Cooperative arcade shooter: arcade physics, local multiplayer input and game feel.","p.sweet-courrier.tagline":"A cooperative shooter where everything comes down to feel.","p.sweet-courrier.meta.role":"Gameplay engineering","p.sweet-courrier.meta.team":"Team project","p.sweet-courrier.ctx":"Sweet Courrier is a cooperative twin-stick arcade shooter. I focused on game feel: control responsiveness and dynamic interaction physics.","p.sweet-courrier.c1":"<strong>Local multiplayer input</strong>: handling several controllers and players on the same screen.","p.sweet-courrier.c2":"<strong>Arcade physics</strong>: dynamic, readable interactions.","p.sweet-courrier.c3":"<strong>Game feel</strong>: responsive controls, visual feedback and play sensations.","pg.watch":"Watch the gameplay video","pg.zoom":"Enlarge","lb.close":"Close","lb.prev":"Previous","lb.next":"Next","contact.linkedin":"LinkedIn","projects.featured":"Featured project","nav.reviews":"Reviews","p.heroes-dawn.c5":"<strong>In-editor design tools</strong> (Unity windows) for items, skills, agents and narration, CSV export for design spreadsheets, and balancing tools (spreadsheet import and simulator).","p.heroes-dawn.c6":"<strong>Production documentation</strong>: GDD, game-design specs, art direction, UI flows and a roadmap (Steam Early Access, then mobile) laid out before writing code.","reviews.eyebrow":"Reviews","reviews.title":"What clients say.","reviews.rating":"5.0","reviews.count":"1 review on Malt","reviews.cta":"See my Malt profile","reviews.date":"Review posted on 16/10/2026","reviews.role":"Product Operations Lead, Chukker App LLC","reviews.quote":"Strong all-round contribution across. Djason delivered the first draft of the match simulation algorithms, integrated RP Vision from the GDD with solid stabilisation and performance gains, and set up a clean Unity architecture, Git workflow and documentation. Djason was a reliable partner in production meetings, helping scope and split tasks clearly. Highly recommended for Unity game development.","reviews.note":"Review shown as published on Malt.","contact.malt":"Malt","p.n29-hq.type":"Internal tool","p.n29-hq.role":"Designer & Developer","p.n29-hq.desc":"The private tool I run my freelance business with: projects, time tracking, quotes and invoices, encrypted sync.","p.n29-hq.tagline":"The private cockpit of my freelance business: projects, documents, time tracking and invoicing in one installable app.","p.n29-hq.meta.role":"Design & development","p.n29-hq.meta.team":"Solo, in-house tool","p.n29-hq.ctx":"N29 HQ is the internal app I built to run STUDIO N29 day to day. It is a local-first, installable web app (PWA) that works offline and on my phone, with the same look as this site. Screenshots use fictional demo data.","p.n29-hq.c1":"<strong>Projects and tasks</strong>: several projects, each with its own kanban board and Markdown documents edited visually (fonts, sizes, styles, tables).","p.n29-hq.c2":"<strong>Time tracking</strong>: timer and calendar entries with date-range reports, in the spirit of Toggl.","p.n29-hq.c3":"<strong>Quotes and invoices</strong> following French legal requirements: continuous numbering, hash-chained issued documents, credit notes, deposits.","p.n29-hq.c4":"<strong>End-to-end encrypted sync</strong>: AES-GCM with a passphrase, stored on Supabase with row-level security, 3-way merge across devices.","p.n29-hq.c5":"<strong>Production tools</strong>: an improved Apex prompt generator for illustration work.","nav.games":"Games","nav.heroes":"Heroes Dawn","nav.studio":"Studio","wish.cta":"Wishlist on Steam","wish.soon":"Out January 15, 2027","foot.tag":"Independent game studio based in Hauts-de-France, France.","foot.games":"Games","foot.all":"All games","foot.studio":"Studio","foot.follow":"Contact","page.home.title":"STUDIO N29 — Independent game studio | Heroes Dawn","page.home.desc":"STUDIO N29 is an independent game studio. Heroes Dawn, our tactical management RPG, is out on January 15, 2027 on Android, iOS and Steam.","page.hd.title":"Heroes Dawn — Tactical management RPG | STUDIO N29","page.hd.desc":"Heroes Dawn, a tactical management RPG by STUDIO N29: board exploration, combat on a timeline and squad building. Out January 15, 2027 on Android, iOS and Steam.","page.games.title":"Games — STUDIO N29","page.games.desc":"All the games and tools made by STUDIO N29: Heroes Dawn, Discosmos, Beat Strike, Delight, Sweet Courrier and more.","page.studio.title":"The studio — Our design philosophy | STUDIO N29","page.studio.desc":"STUDIO N29 is an independent game studio. Discover how we design: choices that matter, readable games and worlds that echo.","page.contact.title":"Contact — STUDIO N29","page.contact.desc":"Contact STUDIO N29: missions for publishers and game companies, collaborations, press and Heroes Dawn news.","h.feat.eyebrow":"Featured game","h.feat.sub":"A tactical management RPG in a world where humans have become metahumans.","h.feat.cta2":"Discover the game","h.feat.text":"Lead a squad of metahumans: explore a board that unfolds as you advance, combine your agents' powers on the combat timeline and run The Dawn's headquarters between missions.","h.pillars.eyebrow":"The game","h.pillars.title":"Read every turn. Plan every mission.","h.p1.t":"Combat on an active timeline","h.p1.d":"Every action has a cost and a place on the timeline. Interrupt, parry and combine skills — and see your enemies' next move before they make it.","h.p2.t":"Explore the board","h.p2.d":"Roll the dice and choose your path across each zone: fights, resources, events and objectives, under a time budget that forces real choices.","h.p3.t":"Run your HQ","h.p3.d":"Between missions, manage your agents, your grimoire of skill cards, equipment and quests. Every upgrade changes how your squad plays.","h.shots.eyebrow":"In the game","h.shots.title":"Straight from the latest build.","h.shots.cta":"See all screenshots","h.studio.eyebrow":"The studio","h.studio.title":"Games with gameplay you can feel.","h.studio.text":"STUDIO N29 is an independent game studio based in Hauts-de-France. We build Unity games around readable, responsive mechanics, and the tools and systems that make them possible.","h.studio.cta":"Meet the studio","h.f1":"projects","h.f2":"main engine","h.f3":"shared universe","h.f4":"studio languages","h.games.eyebrow":"Portfolio","h.games.title":"More from the studio.","h.games.cta":"All games","h.work.eyebrow":"Work with us","h.work.title":"Need a gameplay team?","h.work.lead":"Prototype, team reinforcement, multiplayer, editor tools: the studio takes on missions for publishers and game companies.","h.work.cta":"Start a project","h.s1.t":"Gameplay & systems","h.s1.d":"Mechanics, combat, abilities and game feel, built to be read, tuned and extended by designers.","h.s2.t":"Multiplayer & networking","h.s2.d":"Synchronous netcode, state replication and lag compensation, proven on a competitive 3D MOBA.","h.s3.t":"Tools & pipeline","h.s3.d":"Unity editor tools, data-driven workflows and clean architecture, so your team ships faster.","hd.cap.combat":"Turn-based combat on the active timeline","hd.cap.combat2":"Casting a skill during combat","hd.cap.board":"Board exploration in Red Hook","hd.cap.fog":"Fog of war and zone objectives","hd.cap.hq":"The HQ hub in New York","hd.cap.team":"Squad composition and synergies","hd.cap.sheet":"Agent sheet with skills and gear","hd.cap.grimoire":"The grimoire of skill cards","hd.cap.chapters":"Chapters of the campaign","hd.cap.dialogue":"Narrative choices","hd.cap.minigame":"Rhythm mini-game","hd.cap.quests":"Quest journal","hd.cap.shop":"Shop and card boosters","hd.cap.roster":"Agent roster","hd.hero.eyebrow":"STUDIO N29 presents","hd.hero.tag":"A tactical management RPG in a world where humans have become metahumans.","hd.hero.cta2":"Screenshots","hd.m.genre":"Genre","hd.m.genre.v":"Tactical management RPG","hd.m.platform":"Platforms","hd.m.platform.v":"Android, iOS and Steam","hd.m.engine":"Engine","hd.m.status":"Release","hd.m.status.v":"January 15, 2027","hd.about.eyebrow":"The game","hd.about.title":"A squad. A world that has changed. One choice at a time.","hd.about.p1":"Five years after the Paris Supernova, humans have become metahumans: powers awaken and the world is torn between fear, fascination and hope. Join The Dawn, an organization protecting metahumans and civilians in the Apex Universe, prepare your squad and use your agents' powers to overcome every obstacle.","hd.about.p2":"Every mission begins with a choice: pick your route across the board, recruit the right agents and prepare your next outing at headquarters. Heroes Dawn is out on January 15, 2027 on Android, iOS and Steam.","hd.f1.t":"Combat on a timeline","hd.f1.d":"Follow the combat timeline, manage your agents' energy and play their skill cards. Strike, protect or support: every decision shapes the balance of your squad.","hd.f2.t":"A board that unfolds","hd.f2.d":"Roll the die to gain movement points, study the available paths and choose your destination. The fog hides what comes next: push forward to uncover encounters, battles and objectives.","hd.f3.t":"Build your squad","hd.f3.d":"Recruit agents with different abilities, assemble your team and look for synergies between its members. Prepare their skills and equipment to shape your strategy.","hd.f4.t":"Headquarters, your base","hd.f4.d":"Between missions, manage your team, review objectives, craft equipment and organize expeditions. Preparation is part of the adventure.","hd.f5.t":"A campaign that starts in New York","hd.f5.d":"Choose your mission on the map, follow the objectives of each zone and unlock the next ones as the campaign advances.","hd.f6.t":"Mini-games","hd.f6.d":"Rhythm, infiltration, engineering and survival challenges break up the missions and reward the squad.","hd.gal.eyebrow":"Screenshots","hd.gal.title":"The latest build.","hd.gal.lead":"Captured in-game. Click an image to enlarge it.","hd.art.eyebrow":"Art","hd.art.title":"The agents.","hd.art.lead":"Character illustrations from the production.","hd.road.eyebrow":"Roadmap","hd.road.title":"Where the game is going.","hd.road.lead":"From the current version to launch day.","hd.road.1.s":"Now","hd.road.1.t":"Version 1.0.2","hd.road.1.d":"A playable campaign with exploration, combat, headquarters, quests and the redesigned tactical interface.","hd.road.2.s":"January 15, 2027","hd.road.2.t":"Launch","hd.road.2.d":"Heroes Dawn is released on Android, iOS and Steam.","hd.road.3.s":"Then","hd.road.3.t":"Android release","hd.road.3.d":"An Android build already exists and the interface is designed for touch; the Google Play release follows.","hd.tech.eyebrow":"Under the hood","hd.tech.title":"Built to last.","hd.tech.p":"Heroes Dawn is built in <strong>Unity 6</strong> with a layered <strong>clean architecture</strong>: an MVP interface, a pure-C# domain package, dependency injection and EditMode / PlayMode tests. In-editor tools let the team author items, skills, agents and narration, and balance the game from spreadsheets.","hd.cta.eyebrow":"Out January 15, 2027","hd.cta.title":"Join the squad.","hd.cta.lead":"Heroes Dawn launches on Android, iOS and Steam. Wishlist it on Steam to be notified on launch day.","hd.cta.press":"Press & contact","g.eyebrow":"Portfolio","g.title":"Our games.","g.lead":"Networking, spells, rhythm, controllers, combat systems: every project, and what we built in it.","g.f.all":"All","g.f.game":"Games","g.f.tool":"Tools & apps","s.eyebrow":"The studio","s.title":"Games designed around the player's choices.","s.lead":"STUDIO N29 is an independent studio. We start from the experience we want players to live, then shape every system, every screen and every world around it.","s.v1.t":"Feel first","s.v1.d":"A mechanic is finished when it feels right in the hands, not when it compiles.","s.v2.t":"Readable code","s.v2.d":"Clean architecture and tools so a whole team can pick a project up and extend it.","s.v3.t":"Small loops","s.v3.d":"Prototype fast, iterate often and keep the game playable at every step.","s.apex.eyebrow":"The universe","s.apex.title":"One universe, many games.","s.apex.p1":"The Apex Universe is the shared universe of STUDIO N29's projects: characters, factions and places that connect from one game to the next.","s.apex.p2":"Heroes Dawn is its first big chapter, set in a world where humans have become metahumans. A new project, Hell Rising, has just entered conception.","s.exp.title":"What the studio takes on.","s.founder.eyebrow":"Behind the studio","s.founder.title":"Founded by Djason Nathiez.","s.founder.p1":"STUDIO N29 is led by <strong>Djason Nathiez</strong>, trained at Rubika (Supinfogame), who designs and builds the studio's games.","s.founder.p2":"He likes mechanics that feel good in the hands and games that respect the player's time: readable combat, choices that matter, no padding.","nav.portfolio":"Portfolio","foot.rights":"All rights reserved.","sub.overview":"Overview","sub.gameplay":"Gameplay","sub.agents":"Characters","sub.screens":"Screenshots","sub.roadmap":"Roadmap","dock.1.s":"Out January 15, 2027","dock.1.t":"Heroes Dawn","dock.2.s":"New project","dock.2.t":"Hell Rising","dock.3.s":"The studio","dock.3.t":"Meet STUDIO N29","h.agents.eyebrow":"The agents","h.agents.title":"The agents of The Dawn.","h.agents.lead":"Illustrations from the game: humans awakened after the Paris Supernova, and the cryptides of Salem. They are all agents of The Dawn.","h.apex.cta":"Discover the universe","hd.feat.eyebrow":"Gameplay","hd.feat.title":"How it plays.","s.val.eyebrow":"Our approach","s.val.title":"What we believe in.","s.team.eyebrow":"The team","s.team.title":"Behind the studio.","s.founder.name":"Djason Nathiez","s.founder.cta":"See the portfolio","page.portfolio.title":"Portfolio — Djason Nathiez, Unity gameplay programmer | STUDIO N29","page.portfolio.desc":"Portfolio of Djason Nathiez, Unity gameplay programmer and founder of STUDIO N29: Discosmos, Beat Strike, Delight, Heroes Dawn and more.","pf.eyebrow":"Portfolio","pf.title":"Djason Nathiez, Unity gameplay programmer.","pf.lead":"A selection of games and tools built by the founder of STUDIO N29: networking, spells, rhythm engines, controllers and editor tools. For each project: what I actually did.","pf.cta":"Work together","pf.projects":"Projects","pf.skills":"Skills","pf.journey":"Journey","pf.reviews":"Client reviews","c.eyebrow":"Contact","c.title":"Let's talk.","c.lead":"A mission, a collaboration, a press request or just a question about Heroes Dawn: write to us.","c.pro.title":"Publishers & clients","c.players.title":"Players","c.players.d":"Heroes Dawn is out on January 15, 2027 on Android, iOS and Steam. The store links will appear here and on the game page as soon as the pages are live.","hd.cap.missions":"Mission selection on the New York map","hd.cap.recruit":"Recruiting new agents","hd.cap.craft":"Equipment crafting at headquarters","hd.cap.expeditions":"Organizing expeditions","hd.cap.stealth":"Infiltration mini-game","hd.cap.pass":"Season pass and daily activities","hd.art.agent":"Agent","hd.art.cryptid":"Cryptid","hr.eyebrow":"New project · Early development","hr.tag":"An action game set in the Hells of the Apex Universe. The project has just started: it is too early to say more, but we are already at work.","hr.c1":"Narrative action","hr.c2":"Solo · 3D","hr.c3":"Apex Universe","hr.cta":"Discover the project","page.hr.title":"Hell Rising — A new STUDIO N29 project","page.hr.desc":"Hell Rising is the new STUDIO N29 project: a narrative action game set in the Hells of the Apex Universe. Conception has just started.","hr.p.eyebrow":"The project","hr.p.title":"What we can say for now.","hr.p.lead":"Conception started in November 2026. Everything below is an intention, not a promise.","hr.i1.t":"Fluid, powerful combat","hr.i1.d":"Strikes, fire and movement chained together: the game must feel good in the hands from the first minute.","hr.i2.t":"Hells to discover","hr.i2.d":"A world with inhabitants and stories that go beyond the main quest.","hr.i3.t":"A concentrated story","hr.i3.d":"A focused adventure, enriched by meaningful detours.","hr.v.eyebrow":"First look","hr.v.title":"A mood, not a promise.","hr.v.lead":"Early concept art that sets the tone. Nothing here is final.","hr.cap1":"Concept art — a ruined plain in the Hells","hr.cap2":"Concept art — indicative view of the game","hr.note":"Concept art made during the pilot phase of the art direction. Gameplay, characters and story are still being defined.","hr.follow":"Want to follow the project?","hr.follow.cta":"Get in touch","hd.release.line":"January 15, 2027 · Android · iOS · Steam","s.manifesto":"A good game gives you decisions that matter, in a world you want to stay in.","s.phil.eyebrow":"Design philosophy","s.phil.title":"How we design.","s.p1.t":"Choice at the centre","s.p1.d":"Every mission begins with a choice. We design decisions the player can read, weigh and own, not just reflexes to react to.","s.p2.t":"Readable above all","s.p2.d":"Players should always understand what is happening and why. Clear information and a clean interface come before spectacle.","s.p3.t":"Feel first","s.p3.d":"A mechanic is finished when it feels right in the hands, not merely when it works. We iterate until the sensation is there.","s.p4.t":"Characters that matter","s.p4.d":"Heroes are more than silhouettes: each one has their own powers and their own story.","s.p5.t":"Worlds that echo","s.p5.d":"Our games share one universe, the Apex Universe. Characters, factions and places travel from one game to the next.","s.p6.t":"Focused rather than long","s.p6.d":"We prefer a concentrated adventure with detours that matter over padding. Every hour must earn its place.","s.prac.eyebrow":"In practice","s.prac.title":"The philosophy, in our games.","s.hd.eyebrow":"In Heroes Dawn","s.hd.title":"Choices you can read.","s.hd.text":"The combat timeline shows who acts next, so every decision is made with the full picture. Between missions, headquarters turns preparation into a part of the game.","s.hr.eyebrow":"In Hell Rising","s.hr.title":"Power that feels good.","s.hr.text":"Our new project starts from the sensation: fluid, powerful combat and a concentrated story. It is too early to say more.","sub.lore":"The world","s.apex.lore":"Understand the lore","lore.eyebrow":"The world","lore.title":"The world, in brief.","lore.lead":"Heroes Dawn is set in the Apex Universe, the shared universe of STUDIO N29's games. Here is what you need to know before joining The Dawn.","lore.t1.y":"1981","lore.t1.t":"The Apex Unit","lore.t1.d":"In the middle of the Cold War, the United States creates the Apex Unit: the very first metahumans.","lore.t2.y":"2026","lore.t2.t":"The Paris Supernova","lore.t2.d":"One night, a phenomenon strikes Paris. Across the world, people's genes are altered. For most, nothing changes; in some, a power lies dormant.","lore.t3.y":"5 years later","lore.t3.t":"Heroes Dawn","lore.t3.d":"Powers awaken after a sudden shock. The world is torn between fear, fascination and hope, and institutions try to control the metahumans. You join The Dawn.","lore.c1.t":"The Dawn","lore.c1.d":"An organization founded by metahumans who chose not to hide. Its symbol is a golden four-pointed star. It protects metahumans and civilians.","lore.c2.t":"The AMIF","lore.c2.d":"An agency that claims to supervise metahumans for their safety, but studies and takes their abilities. The Dawn's main official threat.","lore.c3.t":"The Apex","lore.c3.d":"The everyday nickname of metahumans, taken from the original Apex Unit. The official term remains “metahuman”.","sub.alpha":"Alpha","alpha.eyebrow":"Android Alpha","alpha.title":"Join the Alpha.","alpha.lead":"Try Heroes Dawn on Android before everyone else. Sign up with the email of your Google account and we will invite you to the Alpha on Google Play.","alpha.note":"Use the address linked to your Google Play account: it is the one the invitation is sent to.","alpha.email":"Google account email","alpha.placeholder":"you@gmail.com","alpha.consent":"I agree that STUDIO N29 stores my email address to invite me to the Heroes Dawn Alpha. I can ask for it to be deleted at any time.","alpha.submit":"Sign up for the Alpha","alpha.cta":"Join the Android Alpha","alpha.sending":"Sending…","alpha.ok":"You are on the list! Your invitation will be sent by email.","alpha.bad":"Please enter a valid email address.","alpha.noconsent":"Please tick the box to continue.","alpha.err":"Sign-up failed. Please try again, or write to us:","alpha.privacy":"Your address is only used to invite you to the Alpha.","ag.agent-d.t":"Imagination made real","ag.agent-d.d":"Brings whatever he imagines into reality: objects, structures, temporary creatures.","ag.darius-brooks.t":"Animated matter","ag.darius-brooks.d":"Animates and controls inorganic objects: metal, stone, wood, furniture.","ag.mei-lin-chen.t":"Fire control","ag.mei-lin-chen.d":"Creates, directs and smothers flames.","ag.kwame-abara.t":"Animal metamorphosis","ag.kwame-abara.d":"Transforms partially or fully into an animal (crocodile, lion, raptor and more).","ag.noah-kaplan.t":"Transposition","ag.noah-kaplan.d":"Swaps places with an object or a person within sight.","ag.freya-lindqvist.t":"Telepathy","ag.freya-lindqvist.d":"Reads and transmits thoughts, and communicates at a distance by mind alone.","ag.giulia-rossi.t":"Telekinesis","ag.giulia-rossi.d":"Moves, lifts and hurls objects with the power of thought.","ag.tunde-oyelaran.t":"Pocket dimensions","ag.tunde-oyelaran.d":"Creates temporary or permanent dimensional spaces to store, hide or trap.","ag.lucas-mendes.t":"Intangibility","ag.lucas-mendes.d":"Lets matter pass straight through the body, at the cost of being unable to strike or be struck.","ag.rin-takeda.t":"Electromagnetic waves","ag.rin-takeda.d":"Emits, captures, jams and manipulates electromagnetic waves (radio, Wi-Fi, electricity).","ag.amara-hughes.t":"Emotional resonance","ag.amara-hughes.d":"Senses and influences the emotions of crowds or individuals, to soothe, excite or focus.","ag.ilona-varga.t":"Materialized fears","ag.ilona-varga.d":"Gives a physical, tangible form to the fears of targets.","ag.louis-dubois.t":"Magnetic fields","ag.louis-dubois.d":"Creates and controls magnetic fields, pulling or pushing metal and charged objects.","ag.ada-okonkwo.t":"Biokinesis","ag.ada-okonkwo.d":"Manipulates the DNA of living beings: heal, mutate, speed up or slow down biological processes.","ag.victor-sorel.t":"Mind control","ag.victor-sorel.d":"Takes control of targets' minds for a limited time.","ag.fatou-diallo.t":"Kinetic energy","ag.fatou-diallo.d":"Turns kinetic energy into projectiles, shields and barriers.","ag.clement-lefevre.t":"Illusions","ag.clement-lefevre.d":"Creates visual and audio illusions that fool targets' senses.","ag.youssef-haddad.t":"Enhanced senses","ag.youssef-haddad.d":"Sharpens every sense tenfold: sight, hearing, smell, touch and a “sixth sense”.","ag.marco-bellini.t":"Contact alchemy","ag.marco-bellini.d":"Transforms the composition of an object or material with a simple touch.","ag.severine-morel.t":"Life-force vampirism","ag.severine-morel.d":"Absorbs targets' life energy to heal or grow stronger.","ag.ji-hoon-park.t":"Invisibility","ag.ji-hoon-park.d":"Turns body and gear invisible, without erasing sounds or smells.","ag.agent-m.t":"Sight across time","ag.agent-m.d":"Perceives the past, present and future of everything around her.","ag.sam-okafor.t":"Kinetic absorption","ag.sam-okafor.d":"Absorbs blows and kinetic energy, then releases it as a shockwave or a burst of strength.","ag.astrid-hallstrom.t":"Water control","ag.astrid-hallstrom.d":"Manipulates water in all its forms, from rain to steam.","ag.celeste-moreau.t":"Gas production","ag.celeste-moreau.d":"Produces and spreads gases with varied effects: toxic, anesthetic or euphoric.","ag.anna-petrov.t":"Teleportation","ag.anna-petrov.d":"Teleports over short and medium distances, to places already known.","ag.haruto-nakamura.t":"Astral projection","ag.haruto-nakamura.d":"Separates mind from body to explore, spy or act from afar.","ag.eero-nieminen.t":"Gravity","ag.eero-nieminen.d":"Raises or lowers gravity locally, to crush targets or move through the air.","ag.mateo-vasquez.t":"Blood control","ag.mateo-vasquez.d":"Controls blood, targets' or their own: stop a hemorrhage, force clotting, or make it flow.","ag.zofia-kowalczyk.t":"Sound","ag.zofia-kowalczyk.d":"Creates, amplifies, distorts or cancels sound. Can produce destructive waves.","ag.odile-ferrand.t":"Local time dilation","ag.odile-ferrand.d":"Slows down or speeds up time in a limited area.","ag.yelena-ivanova.t":"Cryokinesis","ag.yelena-ivanova.d":"Creates and controls ice and intense cold: frost, crystals, barriers.","ag.kraken.t":"Marine cryptid","ag.kraken.d":"Tentacles that grab, crush and hurl. Senses vibrations in water and ground.","ag.mante.t":"Flying cryptid","ag.mante.d":"Energy blades on the forearms, short flight on translucent wings, heightened reflexes.","ag.caprin.t":"Land cryptid","ag.caprin.d":"Levitates and moves rocks and crystals. Great physical strength.","ag.phalene.t":"Nocturnal winged cryptid","ag.phalene.d":"Silent flight, perfect night vision, and draws and concentrates light to dazzle.","ag.famine.t":"Winter cryptid","ag.famine.d":"Absorbs the heat of living beings. The hungrier, the bigger the body grows and the harder the skin gets.","ag.pied-grand.t":"Forest cryptid","ag.pied-grand.d":"Colossal strength, great leaps, and ground slams that cause small tremors.","ag.lupin.t":"Lycanthrope cryptid","ag.lupin.d":"Partial or full transformation into a wolfdog. Extreme sense of smell, powerful bites.","ag.pierre.t":"Statuary cryptid","ag.pierre.d":"Stone skin that withstands impacts. Freezes into a statue to avoid blows.","ag.suceur.t":"Predator cryptid","ag.suceur.d":"Lightning-fast four-legged sprint, retractable fanged jaws, a sense of smell that detects blood from miles away.","zone.ny":"New York","zone.paris":"Paris","zone.moscow":"Moscow","zone.salem":"Salem","zone.all":"All"}};
